 "face": {
  "mode": "baked",
  "note": "The eyes are glossy gold lenses (lo_eyes) with the iris, the oval pupil, the catchlights and the upper lash line baked into the body atlas; the brows, the eye rings, the cheek ember dashes, the nose, the cat smile and the whisker dots are baked into the body. No face sheet and no morphs: expressions in clips' `faces` are hints only. Blinking scales the blink bones (play `blink` over any clip): each lens squashes onto the closed lid's lash line and sinks into the head, showing the closed lid sculpted and painted under it. The embers (the spine herringbone, the tail end, the ear tufts, the cheek dashes, the claws) are painted in the atlas. The mouth opens: the lips are cut along the crease under the whisker pads, the lower jaw rides the jaw bone, and a mouth prop (palate, tongue, throat and two small fangs, inside the lips) shows when it does.",
